{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5089c73ddb2e2e19","name":"Sonic Disruptor","source":{"id":"source:reference-5089c73ddb2e2e19","title":"Sonic Disruptor","revision":19346,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:47:00Z","sha256":"8c774540c7bf3c4e1eba82bb613d6028055d1f69968792dfe3753f4a827b2fff","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19346","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sonic%20Disruptor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5089c73ddb2e2e19","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One of the most violent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sonic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sonic"}," weapons on the market, the Sonic Disruptor is outlawed by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"},", even for use against ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},". The Sonic Disruptor not only deals devastating ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sonic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sonic"}," damage to a target, it also atomizes anything it harms, leaving few traces of a victim behind.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Like all weapons that deal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sonic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sonic"}," damage, a Sonic Disruptor's attacks cannot be negated using the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]}," Talent (or any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," with ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]}," as a prerequisite).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a Disruptor Weapon, the Sonic Disruptor treats all targets as if their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," was 5 points lower than it is. If damage from the Sonic Disruptor kills or destroys a target, that target is disintegrated and ceases to exist. Because of the massive energy required to create a Disruptor beam, the Sonic Disruptor can fire only once every other round. You cannot use any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"},", or other special ability that consumes more than one shot from the weapon per round (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Shot","referenceId":"reference:d5cac053fa8ba463"},") with a Sonic Disruptor.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Sonic Disruptor requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"},". After 10 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be recharged.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Small\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot (see above)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy (",{"tag":"a","children":["Sonic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sonic"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
